![stronghold_slide](../../assets/posts/kickoff-begins-2016-stronghold-game-announced/stronghold_slide.jpg)

FIRST Robotics announced the new 2016 Game -- Stronghold -- in a live broadcast to more than 3100 FRC teams around the world. Bainbridge High was busy at 7:00 am today (Saturday, Jan. 8th) as the game was announced.  

Spartronics Team 4915, now in our third year, will spend the next six weeks building our new robot for this game, and competitions will begin in March.  More than 1 million students in 83 countries have participated in FIRST, now entering its 26th year.
